# TF2's shield charge (specs/tf2/batch3_mechanics.md 1): a Demoman with the
# Eyelander and the Chargin' Targe; attack2 with forward held charges at
# 750 units/s for 1.5 s, the HUD's item meter (CHARGE) draining, then
# refilling over 12 s. Needs the item pack (an asset store with `items`).
#   CHIMERA_ASSET_STORE=<store> cargo run --features dev --bin ultimate_gun_game -- --offscreen 1600x900 +volume 0 +sandbox \
#       --scene apps/ultimate_gun_game/scenes/tf2_charge.scene --out <dir>
wait_for map_loaded 6000
wait_for spawned 3000
wait 120
god
sandbox ammo on
rung tf2:eyelander
wait 2
give tf2:chargin_targe
wait 2
wait_for idle 3000
wait 120
shot charge_full
+forward
wait 10
+attack2
wait 5
-attack2
wait 25
shot charging
wait 90
-forward
wait 30
shot charge_refilling
